      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Playing in desktop mode I can use the hardware keyboard to enter a search query. But in VR I have to use software keyboard and click each letter. It’s not comfortable. Voice input is more comfortable for VR. In addition to soft keyboard we need voice input. “IN ADDITION” but not instead of it, because voice recognition technology is not perfect yet.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/HbDnxzrbxn4",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
