      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat would actually have to build their own custom engine for this.\n\nBut anyways, our group just realized this would be a nice feature to add in general. There's also a few other technologies that could be used to do this:\n\n- Faster Whispr\n\n- Vosk\n\nBoth use light AI Models that can achieve speech-to-text.\n\nIt would be nice to see a mic for text input command in various places, or even to be able to activate it without popping the text input window.\n\nBut this goes hand in hand with another feature suggestion we have with the video player:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/if-not-url-use-search-feature-instead",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
