  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-04-30T04:23:13.654Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, I'm trying to make a NPC for a virtual assistant in the world on VRchat(Like \"Siri\"), and I noticed that, scripts about Voice Recognition(UnityEngine.Windows.Speech) are not in whitelist. \n\nso Could I request add the scripts to whitelist? If Scripts added in list, It will be able to make NPC. In additon to this, It will be able to turn on/off the triggers without uisng pulldown/up or Interact etc.",
